1
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,560
- Two little bees~
- Two little bees~
-两只小蜜蜂啊
-两只小蜜蜂啊

2
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,000
- Flying among the flowers~
- Flying among the flowers~
-飞到花丛中啊
-飞到花丛中啊

3
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,640
- Left they fly, right they fly~
- Left they fly, right they fly~
-左飞飞，右飞飞
-左飞飞，右飞飞

4
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,320
- Nice!
- Drink…
-漂亮
-喝…

5
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,640
- Two little bees~
- Two little bees~
-两只小蜜蜂啊
-两只小蜜蜂啊

6
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:27,400
- Come on.
- Flying among the flowers~
-来
-飞到花丛中啊

7
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,960
- Left they fly~
- Left they fly~
-左飞飞
-左飞飞

8
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,760
Drink up.
喝酒吧

9
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,559
President Lu, what are you up to?
卢总干啥呢？

10
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:35,960
- There's still booze left, come on…
- How about we each drink half?
-还剩酒呢，快…
-一人喝一半好不好？

11
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:37,520
Any more and it'll drink us to death.
再喝真的要醉死人的啊

12
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,400
What'd you spend your money coming here for?
你花钱来这干啥来了？

13
00:02:39,480 --> 00:02:41,720
If you don't get drunk, you've wasted it. Come on.
不醉不是白花钱了吗？ 快

14
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:43,160
I'll drink for Brother Lu.
我替卢哥喝

15
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:46,360
Little sister-in-law's the one who looks out for big brother.
还是小嫂子向着哥啊

16
00:02:46,440 --> 00:02:47,600
Little sister-in-law?
小嫂子？

17
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,680
Hey.
嗨

18
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:55,240
Wait for me a moment, Miss Shen.
妳等我一下，沉小姐

19
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:56,360
Wait for me.
等我一下

20
00:02:58,440 --> 00:02:59,400
Come on, little sister-in-law.
来，小嫂子

21
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,440
Let's you and me drink.
咱俩喝

22
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,640
- One more round.
- One more round.
-再来一盘
-再来一盘

23
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:10,280
Right now?
现在吗？

24
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,160
Is that alright…
方便…

25
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,200
Okay.
好

26
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:16,680
Okay.
好

27
00:03:16,760 --> 00:03:17,760
I'll come alone.
我一个人过来

28
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,200
Okay.
好

29
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:20,600
Okay.
好

30
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,240
Wait for me.
妳等我

31
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,600
Who was that, President Lu?
谁呀，卢总？

32
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:32,080
Do I need to report to you?
我需要向妳汇报吗？

33
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:34,000
No. Just asking.
不用，随便问问

34
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,200
What's this supposed to mean?
这是啥意思？

35
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:52,640
Just a little something.
小意思

36
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,760
Miss Shen.
沉小姐

37
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,640
Get in.
上车

38
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:58,240
I really didn't expect you'd come to me on your own.
真没想到妳会主动找我啊

39
00:05:02,880 --> 00:05:04,320
I've thought it through.
我想明白了

40
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:07,480
Yin Hong was creating an opportunity for me.
殷红是在给我创造机会

41
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,400
You won't have to stay in the dorm anymore.
妳以后不用再住宿舍了

42
00:05:11,880 --> 00:05:13,720
That suite of mine at the Jinhao—
我在金豪那个套房

43
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,120
you can move in anytime you like.
妳随时可以过去住的啊

44
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:25,360
So tonight, you'll come to my place—
那么今晚妳去我那边

45
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:27,800
is that okay?
可以吗？

46
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:33,400
Could you come with me to my friend's first to pick up some books?
能先陪我去我朋友那拿几本书吗？

47
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:35,120
I need them for class tomorrow.
我明天上课要用

48
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:39,480
Sure.
可以啊

49
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:52,080
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

50
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,360
Your friend's not home?
妳朋友不在啊？

51
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:09,200
She went home for a few days.
她这几天回家了

52
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:18,640
Have a seat for a bit.
你先坐一会吧

53
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,200
Okay.
好

54
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,640
I know this movie star well.
这个明星我很熟啊

55
00:06:44,720 --> 00:06:46,760
We often go out for tea together.
我们经常一起出来喝茶的

56
00:06:49,760 --> 00:06:50,880
Is that so?
是吗？

57
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:55,000
When there's time, I'll take you to Hong Kong.
有空带妳去香港

58
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:56,760
I'll introduce you to him.
把他介绍给妳认识

59
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:02,040
Weren't you going to look for something?
妳不要找东西吗？

60
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:05,400
Right.
对

61
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:07,840
I'll be back down in a bit.
那我一会下来

62
00:07:07,920 --> 00:07:08,920
Have a seat.
你先坐

63
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,400
Okay.
好

64
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,600
Can I use that restroom?
那个洗手间可以用吗？

65
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,040
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

66
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,080
It's broken.
坏了

67
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,600
That restroom's broken.
这个洗手间坏了

68
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:22,880
Use the one on the second floor.
用二楼的吧

69
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,240
Okay.
好

70
00:07:26,200 --> 00:07:27,200
This way.
这边

71
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:33,320
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

72
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:07,960
Did you find it?
找到没啊？

73
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,240
I don't know where I put it.
不知道放哪了

74
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:13,960
I still have to keep looking.
我还得再找找

75
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,920
It's alright.
没关系的啊

76
00:08:20,960 --> 00:08:22,520
Here works just fine for me too.
我在妳这里也可以啊

77
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,240
What's wrong?
怎么了？

78
00:08:25,320 --> 00:08:26,320
Feeling shy?
害羞了？

79
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,880
It's not like it's your first time.
又不是第一次

80
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,760
Just relax.
放轻松点

81
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:35,840
Miss Shen.
沉小姐

82
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:40,520
The difference between people and animals—
人和动物有什么区别

83
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:42,320
do you know what it is?
妳知道吗？

84
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,640
There's no difference.
没有区别的

85
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,040
People—
人

86
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:52,080
once they take off their clothes—
脱掉衣服之后

87
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:54,040
aren't they just animals?
不就是动物了吗？

88
00:09:10,760 --> 00:09:12,160
I'm not an animal.
我不是动物

89
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,280
I'm a person.
我是人

90
00:09:21,920 --> 00:09:23,360
I'm not an animal.
我不是动物

91
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:27,680
Screw you.
去你的

92
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:31,320
So it's a honey trap?
仙人跳啊？

93
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,200
Playing me?
搞我？

94
00:09:33,280 --> 00:09:34,880
You dare play me?
妳敢搞我？

95
00:09:35,440 --> 00:09:36,680
Playing me?
搞我？

96
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:43,160
Shen Mo!
沈墨

97
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,080
Are you okay?
妳没事吧？

98
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:49,080
It's an anesthetic.
麻药

99
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:50,280
We can't let him get away.
不能让他走

100
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,000
Screw you.
去你的

101
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:55,160
The phone…
听电话…

102
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:52,880
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

103
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,040
I'm sorry.
对不起

104
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,240
I'm truly sorry.
真的对不起

105
00:11:37,960 --> 00:11:40,600
If I've offended you two in any way—
我有什么得罪你们的地方

106
00:11:40,680 --> 00:11:42,080
I apologize.
我跟你们道歉

107
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:44,480
You think an apology can fix what you've done?
你觉得你干过的事，道歉能解决吗？

108
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:48,480
This whole thing really is a misunderstanding.
这件事情真的是误会

109
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:53,760
I've always had the greatest respect for Miss Shen.
我一直很尊重沉小姐的

110
00:11:54,600 --> 00:11:56,920
It was Yin Hong who kept lying to me.
是殷红一直骗我

111
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,840
She told me you were willing.
她說妳是愿意的

112
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,520
Here's what we'll do.
这样

113
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:02,800
You let me go—
你们放我走

114
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:05,040
there's an 800,000-yuan draft in my car.
我车上有一张八十万的汇票

115
00:12:05,120 --> 00:12:06,680
Consider it my compensation to you.
就算是我补偿你们的

116
00:12:06,760 --> 00:12:08,840
And this whole thing never happened.
这件事情就当没有发生过

117
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,160
I'm a man of my word.
我说到做到啊

118
00:12:21,600 --> 00:12:23,280
You're going to stay right here today—
你今天就在这

119
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:26,480
and write down clearly everything you've done in Hualin.
把你在桦林都干过什么 清清楚楚地写下来

120
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,000
What do you want me to write?
你们想要我写什么？

121
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,520
You're still fucking playing dumb?
你他妈还装？

122
00:12:35,600 --> 00:12:37,320
Is this the first time you've pulled this?
你是第一回干这种事吗？

123
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,320
Every day in Hualin—
我每天在桦林

124
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,680
I have a lot of people to meet.
要见很多人的

125
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,640
If I go missing—
如果我不见了

126
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:49,000
plenty of people will come looking for me right away.
马上就会有很多人来找我的

127
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,720
And another thing—
还有

128
00:12:50,800 --> 00:12:52,080
when you made that call—
妳打电话的时候

129
00:12:52,160 --> 00:12:53,760
my driver was right there.
我司机也在场的

130
00:12:54,280 --> 00:12:55,320
So here's the deal—
这样

131
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:57,000
you let me go first—
你们先放我走

132
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,280
and I can treat this whole thing—
我可以把这件事情

133
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,680
as if it never happened.
当作没有发生过

134
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:06,760
Make the call.
打电话

135
00:13:09,280 --> 00:13:10,920
Call your driver.
给你司机打电话

136
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:12,360
Tell him you're fine.
告诉他你没事

137
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:16,800
Have you two watched so many videotapes—
你们是不是录像带看多了

138
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:18,560
that your brains have rotted?
把脑子看坏了？

139
00:13:23,520 --> 00:13:25,440
Kidnapping means prison, you know that?
绑架要坐牢的，知道吗？

140
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:29,960
Somebody, help…!
来人呀…

141
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:38,000
Make the call!
打电话！

142
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,240
I'll call…
我打…

143
00:13:47,960 --> 00:13:53,920
I'll call…
我打…

144
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:56,720
I'll call.
我打

145
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:58,680
I'll call.
我打

146
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,680
Hello? Xiao Luo.
喂？ 小罗

147
00:14:13,560 --> 00:14:14,920
It's… it's nothing.
没…没事

148
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,360
I'm… I'm in…
我…我在…

149
00:14:18,080 --> 00:14:19,160
I'm in the restroom.
我在洗手间

150
00:14:19,760 --> 00:14:21,400
It's fine… really, it's fine.
没事…真没事

151
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:22,920
That's all.
就这样

152
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:26,200
If anything comes up, I'll call you again.
有什么事，我再给你电话

153
00:14:26,840 --> 00:14:28,280
Okay, bye.
好，掰掰

154
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:58,560
What if he really tells them we kidnapped him?
他要真说咱是绑架怎么办？

155
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:01,920
Let's cash out the money.
把钱取出来吧

156
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:03,880
And get out of here.
咱们离开这

157
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,640
I want to cash this.
取钱

158
00:16:17,480 --> 00:16:18,640
Cash all of it.
都取出来

159
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:33,200
Sorry, sir, this one can't be cashed.
不好意思啊，您这个取不了

160
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:35,760
Why not?
为啥？

161
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:44,160
This is a commercial draft payable on a fixed date.
您这个是定日付款的商业汇票

162
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,320
See, it says the 17th right here.
上面不写着17号吗？

163
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,400
It can only be cashed on that date.
规定日期才能取的

164
00:16:52,800 --> 00:16:53,960
One moment, please.
您稍等一下

165
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:56,640
This man says he wants to cash this.
这个人说要取钱

166
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:20,160
Do you know the difference between people and animals?
你知道人和动物有什么区别吗？

167
00:17:26,120 --> 00:17:27,160
People—
人

168
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:32,919
have to pay the price for what they've done.
得为自己做过的事付出代价

169
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:14,280
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

170
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,000
He lied to us.
他骗咱们

171
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,800
I almost got detained at the bank.
我差点让银行给扣下

172
00:18:19,880 --> 00:18:21,440
That fucking bastard.
这他妈王八蛋

173
00:18:22,600 --> 00:18:23,760
Get up.
起来

174
00:18:24,720 --> 00:18:25,920
Get up.
起来

175
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:39,560
He's dead.
他死了

176
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:55,840
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

177
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,280
I'm the one who killed him.
人是我杀的

178
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:31,040
It's got nothing to do with you two.
跟你俩没关系

179
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,480
Why?
为啥呀？

180
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:41,360
We could've just cashed the money and left Hualin together, couldn't we?
咱们取了钱 一起离开桦林不就行了吗？

181
00:19:49,800 --> 00:19:53,800
Do you still want to leave with me now?
你现在还愿意跟我一起走吗？

182
00:20:10,040 --> 00:20:11,080
Go where?
去哪啊？

183
00:20:18,920 --> 00:20:21,080
Somewhere nobody knows us.
去一个没人认识的地方

184
00:20:23,360 --> 00:20:24,560
And live all over again.
重新活一次

185
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,240
Who's there?
谁呀？

186
00:22:57,760 --> 00:22:58,880
What are you doing?
干啥呢？

187
00:23:15,040 --> 00:23:16,040
Wang Yang.
王阳

188
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:35,760
It's a little hot.
有点热

189
00:23:36,280 --> 00:23:37,760
I'll go get you your medicine.
我去给你拿药

190
00:24:19,240 --> 00:24:20,840
We need to find a new place.
得找个新的地方

191
00:24:21,400 --> 00:24:22,600
We can't stay here anymore.
不能再住这了

192
00:24:24,560 --> 00:24:27,800
We'll lie low for a while, and once we get the money we'll come find you.
我们先躲一躲，等拿到钱了再去找你

193
00:24:43,160 --> 00:24:44,440
Go on back.
回去吧

194
00:24:45,400 --> 00:24:46,680
Get a good night's sleep.
好好睡一觉

195
00:24:49,120 --> 00:24:51,880
Just think of it as a dream.
就当是作了一场梦

196
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:57,040
Wouldn't it be nice if it really were a dream?
要真是个梦多好啊？

197
00:24:58,720 --> 00:25:00,640
You wake up and nothing's changed.
醒了什么都没变

198
00:25:15,560 --> 00:25:16,680
Nothing will change.
不会变

199
00:25:19,760 --> 00:25:21,360
Nothing will ever change.
什么都不会变

200
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:35,400
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

201
00:26:17,480 --> 00:26:18,760
What are you here for?
妳来干嘛？

202
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:27,360
Still angry?
还生气呢

203
00:26:29,080 --> 00:26:30,440
It's not that serious, is it?
不至于吧？

204
00:26:35,680 --> 00:26:38,840
Your handkerchief and your brother's clothes—I've washed them all clean.
妳的手绢、妳弟的衣服都洗干净了

205
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:40,040
Just leave them there.
放那吧

206
00:26:45,600 --> 00:26:46,800
Where are you off to?
这是要去哪啊？

207
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:48,040
Nowhere.
不去哪

208
00:26:51,600 --> 00:26:53,800
You should go. I've got things to do.
妳走吧，我还有事

209
00:27:13,080 --> 00:27:14,400
What things?
啥事啊？

210
00:27:18,360 --> 00:27:20,440
You're not going to Hong Kong with President Lu, are you?
不是要跟卢总去香港吧？

211
00:27:27,840 --> 00:27:29,000
Quit pretending.
别装了

212
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:32,360
When you called to set up that meeting with President Lu—
妳打电话约卢总的时候

213
00:27:32,440 --> 00:27:33,760
I heard all of it.
我都听到了

214
00:27:37,520 --> 00:27:38,520
So what?
怎么的？

215
00:27:39,040 --> 00:27:40,440
Figured it out, have you?
想明白了？

216
00:27:41,240 --> 00:27:42,600
How much is he paying you?
他给妳多少钱啊？

217
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,560
800,000.
八十万

218
00:28:00,920 --> 00:28:02,680
Never seen that much money before, have you?
没见过这么多钱吧？

219
00:28:10,080 --> 00:28:12,640
College girls really are a different fucking breed.
大学生还真他妈不一样啊

220
00:28:15,720 --> 00:28:18,120
Lu Wenzhong handing you that kind of money—
卢文仲给妳这么多钱

221
00:28:19,800 --> 00:28:21,800
your little boyfriend doesn't know, does he?
妳那小男朋友不知道吧？

222
00:28:24,160 --> 00:28:25,360
No, he doesn't.
不知道

223
00:28:30,280 --> 00:28:31,920
You really know how to play the game.
还是妳会玩

224
00:28:34,840 --> 00:28:36,520
You get to have it all.
什么都让妳占了

225
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:55,400
He doesn't know now—
他现在不知道

226
00:28:56,120 --> 00:28:57,920
but that doesn't mean he won't find out later.
不一定以后就不知道

227
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,520
Don't get me wrong.
别误会

228
00:29:01,600 --> 00:29:03,360
I'm not threatening you.
我可不是威胁妳

229
00:29:08,560 --> 00:29:10,440
Coming into this fortune—
妳发这笔财

230
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:13,600
shouldn't you be thanking me?
是不是应该感谢我？

231
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:23,000
Take it.
妳拿走吧

232
00:29:26,600 --> 00:29:28,480
Isn't it me you wanted to become?
妳不是想变成我吗？

233
00:29:33,720 --> 00:29:36,040
Take this, and you can become me.
拿走这个，妳就可以变成我了

234
00:29:43,840 --> 00:29:45,920
Then I won't stand on ceremony.
那我可不跟妳客气了

235
00:29:46,680 --> 00:29:47,920
Thanks.
谢了

236
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:01,600
You fucking bitch—
妳他妈的

237
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:25,000
Was Yin Hong here?
殷红来了？

238
00:32:11,600 --> 00:32:13,440
Why did you do it?
为什么这么做？

239
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:22,880
Yin Hong is gone.
殷红没了

240
00:32:27,600 --> 00:32:29,400
She's me now.
她现在是我了

241
00:32:35,080 --> 00:32:37,480
Once you're dead, you don't have to believe in fate anymore.
人死了就不用再信命了

242
00:32:40,920 --> 00:32:42,360
Stop looking for Wang Yang.
别再找王阳了

243
00:32:43,520 --> 00:32:45,520
He can go on living a good life.
他可以好好活着

244
00:37:42,280 --> 00:37:43,200
A bowl of wontons, please.
来碗馄饨

245
00:37:43,840 --> 00:37:46,240
All out. That guy bought up the last three bowls.
没有了，最后三碗全让他包圆了

246
00:38:01,640 --> 00:38:02,680
Thanks.
谢谢啊
